- Sales Invoice (sales.html) – scoped `.si-*`
- Temporary Invoices (temporary_invoices.html) – `.ti-*`
- Cash Receipt List (cash_receipt_list.html) – `.crl-*`
- Temp Settlement (temp_settlement_receipt_list.html) – `.tsrl-*`
- New Cash Receipt (cash_receipt_new.html) – `.crn-*`
- Temporary Pending List (temporary_pending_list.html) – `.tpl-*`
- Temporary Pending Detail (temporary_pending_detail.html) – `.tpd-*`
- Temporary Collection List (temporary_collection_list.html) – `.tcl-*`
- Temporary Collection (temporary_collection.html) – `.page-po`
- Purchase Order form/list – native PO styles

